- The deterministic ordering wrongly used types.FULL_REQUIRED_STRATEGIC_LENSES (porter, pre_mortem, counterparty, ...), which is a required-SET contract, not the execution order. The canonical runtime/registry/Ways order is porter -> counterparty -> pre_mortem -> scenario -> meadows (AGENTS section 7; frozen registry assembly in app/strategic_lenses/registry.py; PRE_MORTEM LensSpec trigger "after_counterparty_matrix_..." in app/agents/lenses.py). Counterparty must precede the Pre-Mortem that consumes its result.
- Fix (services/api/app/analyses/lens_artifact_reads.py only): introduced module-local _CANONICAL_LENS_EXECUTION_ORDER with the corrected sequence and source citations; no importable order tuple exists on the frozen surfaces and importing the registry would drag in every lens implementation, so a documented local constant is used per the correction instructions. No model/migration/contract/strategic_lenses/persistence change; no router.

